---
import SectionTitle from "@/components/shared/section-title.astro"
import { Call02Icon, InternetIcon, Location03Icon, Mail01Icon, MailIcon } from "@hugeicons/core-free-icons"
import { HugeiconsIcon } from "@hugeicons/react"
---

<section class="flex w-full justify-center overflow-hidden bg-white px-4 xl:rounded-br-4xl xl:rounded-bl-4xl">
  <div class="flex w-full max-w-6xl flex-1 flex-col py-26 2xl:max-w-7xl">
    <SectionTitle title="Visa Information & Guidance" subtitle="VISA" description="" />

    <div class="relative grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-10 lg:gap-20">
      <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col gap-4 text-slate-600 md:text-justify">
        <p>
          Participants planning to attend HEALTHMED-IC in Istanbul, Turkey, are advised to check their individual visa requirements well in advance of
          their travel dates. Citizens of certain countries may need to obtain a visa to enter Turkey. To ascertain whether you require a visa, please
          consult the official Turkish Ministry of Foreign Affairs Visa Guide available on their website. Many eligible nationalities can conveniently
          apply for an e-Visa online through the official e-Visa application portal, which offers a straightforward process. For those not eligible
          for an e-Visa, applications should be submitted at the nearest Turkish Embassy or Consulate in their country of residence. It is crucial to
          ensure that your passport remains valid for at least six months beyond your intended period of stay in Turkey. We strongly recommend
          initiating your visa application process as early as possible, as processing times can vary.
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-6 rounded-xl border border-red-100 bg-red-50 p-6 shadow-[inset_0_0_10px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]">
          <h4 class="text-heading text-red-900">Do you need a letter to support your visa application for HEALTHMED-IC 2026?</h4>

          <div class="space-y-4">
            <p class="text-sm text-red-900">
              Yes, we can provide an official letter. We offer a Letter of Invitation that includes a list of registered participants and presenters
              for HEALTHMED-IC 2026, which you may attach to your visa application to facilitate the process.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="relative row-start-1 lg:col-start-2 lg:row-start-1">
        <img src="/assets/images/passport.webp" alt="" class="inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover md:absolute" />
      </div>

      <div class="relative rounded-2xl border border-red-900 bg-red-900 p-6 shadow-[inset_0_0_10px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)] lg:col-span-2">
        <h3 class="mb-4 text-2xl leading-tight font-bold text-red-50 sm:text-3xl">Special Visa Assistance for Indonesian Participants</h3>

        <p class="mb-8 text-base leading-relaxed text-red-50/70 sm:text-lg">
          For ICEHoS 2026 participants traveling from Indonesia, we are pleased to offer a comprehensive travel and hotel accommodation package
          through our trusted travel agent.
        </p>

        <div class="rounded-xl border border-red-600 bg-red-800 p-4">
          <p class="mb-4 text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide text-red-50 uppercase">
            For more information and assistance, please contact our partner via:
          </p>

          <ul class="space-y-4">
            <li>
              <a href="https://npugo.nusaputra.ac.id" target="_blank" class="flex items-center gap-4 text-red-600 transition-colors">
                <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-sm transition-all">
                  <HugeiconsIcon icon={InternetIcon} color="currentColor" size={20} />
                </div>
                <div>
                  <p class="mb-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-red-300">Website</p>
                  <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-red-50 sm:text-base">NPU GO</p>
                </div>
              </a>
            </li>

            <li>
              <a href="tel:+628161110960" class="flex items-center gap-4 text-slate-600 transition-colors">
                <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-sm transition-all">
                  <HugeiconsIcon icon={Call02Icon} color="currentColor" size={20} />
                </div>
                <div>
                  <p class="mb-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-red-300">Phone / WhatsApp</p>
                  <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-red-50 sm:text-base">+62 816-1110-960</p>
                </div>
              </a>
            </li>

            <li>
              <a href="mailto:info@nusaputra.ac.id" class="flex items-center gap-4 text-slate-600 transition-colors">
                <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-sm transition-all">
                  <HugeiconsIcon icon={MailIcon} color="currentColor" size={20} />
                </div>
                <div>
                  <p class="mb-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-red-300">Email</p>
                  <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-red-50 sm:text-base">info@nusaputra.ac.id</p>
                </div>
              </a>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
